<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now I live by the tree of life,</l><l>His fruit does nourish me,</l><l>O, how it strengthens me,</l><l>I’ll live eternally.</l><l>Now I live by the tree of life,</l><l>Him daily I apply,</l><l>He is my food supply.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>There’s a river of life in me,</l><l>Flowing so livingly,</l><l>Moving continually,</l><l>He just keeps flooding me.</l><l>There’s a river of life in me,</l><l>He’s always filling me,</l><l>His name is Jesus Christ!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
